 these options:\n\n<img width=\"246\" height=\"299\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cb318259-8a6f-4321-bfd3-f002f7531f2b\" />\n\n5. Radius does not encompass mesh, but instead chooses the length of the smaller side.\n\n<img width=\"407\" height=\"410\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/08773627-c633-480d-8d58-8144de8ca78d\" />\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114542/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114542/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}